# **Part II: The Identified Trends — What Is Accelerating**

**Trend 1: The Cycles Are Compressing**

In the early months of the record (August–October 2025), each major crisis cycle took roughly one to two weeks to complete: betrayal event, confrontation, silence, escalation, minimal-affection reset, resumption of normalcy. By January 2026 the cycles had shortened to three to five days. In the final two weeks of the record they have compressed to hours.

On February 22 alone: Dan issues a goodbye at 2am, Annie apologizes at 2:24am, Dan returns to grievance at 2:28am, Annie states she wants to fix things at 9pm the following day, Dan demands location access, Annie ignores it, they see each other, she leaves, he crashes out again. One day. All of it.

