This is not someone maintaining distance while still emotionally present. This is someone whose emotional investment has reached a level that can be sustained entirely through habit and minimum viable output. She continues to show up — for the drugs, for the dog, for the brief warmth that comes when she doesn't have to be anywhere. But the content of her communication has been hollowing out for months, and in the final two weeks it is nearly empty.

