This is the profile of someone who is not making a deliberate choice to harm. It is the profile of someone who is unable to make any choice at all. She is caught between two incompatible desires — to keep Dan and to be free of the weight of him — and the inability to choose is expressing itself as a kind of suspended animation that, from Dan's perspective, looks like cruelty because it produces all the same outcomes.

